# Keep the Docker build context small and free of host-built or secret files. Without this,
# `COPY frontend frontend` would drag a host node_modules (wrong platform) into the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.github
caddy_data
caddy_config
pgdata
backend/uploads
.backups
